/**
@mainpage Music Processing Project

@section description_main Description
A python program for manipulating & normalizing audio files.

@section notes_main Notes
Music Processing recognizes the following file types:
- Audio file types:
    - mp3
    - m4a
    - wma
- Playlist file types:
    - m3u

@section usage_main Usage
From a command line (Powershell or Windows cmd):
- >cd <location of main.py>
- >python.exe main.py <arguments>

@section libraries_main Libraries/Modules
3rd party libraries
- mutagen (https://mutagen.readthedocs.io/en/latest/)
- pathvalidate  (https://pathvalidate.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html#)

@section authour_main Authour
Gerald Manweiler

@section copyright_main Copyright
GWN Software @showdate "%Y". All rights reserved.
*/